### Get all motos
GET http://localhost:3000/housing-location
Accept: application/json



### Create a new moto
POST http://localhost:3000/housing-location
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Seriously Safe Towns",
    "city": "Oakland",
    "state": "CA",
    "photo": "https://angular.dev/assets/images/tutorials/common/saru-robert-9rP3mxf8qWI-unsplash.jpg",
    "availableUnits": 10,
    "wifi": false,
    "laundry": false
}
